  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></h2><h2><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎈 שיחה בסמלים -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים</span></span></h2><p data-end=\"265\" data-start=\"197\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👦 <b>יֶלֶד</b>&nbsp;(שׁוֹאֵל)</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">:<br />לָמָּה הַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֹל הוֹלֵךְ כָּל כָּךְ הַרְבֵּה פְּעָמִים?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🏠&gt; 🕯️&gt; ☁️<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מֵחֲצַר הַמִּקְדָּשׁ&nbsp;&gt; לַהֵיכָל &gt; וְעַד קֹדֶשׁ הַקֳּדָשִׁים.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"467\" data-start=\"416\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👦&nbsp;<b>יֶלֶד</b>&nbsp;(מַמְשִׁיךְ לִשְׁאֹל)</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלָמָּה הוּא מַחְלִיף בְּגָדִים כָּל הַזְּמַן?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👘&gt;&nbsp;</span>🤍<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👘</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">צִבְעוֹנִיִּים&gt; לְבָנִים&gt; צִבְעוֹנִיִּים</span></span></p><p data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"469\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">📖<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;<b>פָּרָשַׁת הַשָּׁבוּעַ</b>&nbsp;(עוֹנָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁמַּחְלִיפִים תַּפְקִיד - מַחְלִיפִים לְבוּשׁ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּכְשֶׁנִּכְנָסִים לִפְנִים מְאֹד - נִכְנָסִים בִּפְשִׁיטוּת&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּבְהַכְנָעָה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"608\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">❓&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>יֶלֶד אַחֵר</b> (שׁוֹאֵל):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔥</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהָעָשָׁן? לָמָּה צָרִיךְ עָשָׁן?</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🩸</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַדָּם? זֶה נִשְׁמָע מַפְחִיד…</span></span></p><p data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"608\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">📖<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;<b>פָּרָשַׁת הַשָּׁבוּעַ</b>&nbsp;(עוֹנָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עָשָׁן -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּי אֶת הַקֹּדֶשׁ לֹא רוֹאִים בְּעֵינַיִם -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶלָּא מַרְגִּישִׁים בַּלֵּב.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דָּם -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוּא סִימָן לחַיִּים.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּבְיוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים - מְבַקְּשִׁים חַיִּים נְקִיִּים יוֹתֵר.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"889\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">✨&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>הַתּוֹרָה</b> (מְלַמֶּדֶת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁהוּא יוֹצֵא בְּשָׁלוֹם&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עִם לֵב טָהוֹר וְנָקִי<br />- גַּם אֲנַחְנוּ יְכוֹלִים&nbsp;לְהַתְחִיל מֵחָדָשׁ.</span></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת קרבנות</span></span></h2></div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את 🔍 הקרבנות בפרשה: פַר, חַטָּאת, אַיִל, עֹלָה, עִזִּים, שְּׂעִירִם, קְטֹרֶת, כֶשֶׂב, שׁוֹר, שְׁלָמִים, חֵלֶב.<br />בכיוונים ⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span><br /><br /><a href=\"/assets/images/content/2cba6b804293e69bf9.png\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/2cba6b804293e69bf9.png\" /></a><br /><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֹל נִכְנָס לְקֹדֶשׁ הַקָּדָשִׁים בְּיוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּיוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים, הַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֹל לָבַשׁ בִּגְדֵי לָבָן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּיוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים, שָׁלְחוּ שְׁנֵי שְׂעִירִים לַמִּדְבָּר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה אוֹמֶרֶת שֶׁיּוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים הוּא יוֹם שִׂמְחָה וַאֲכִילָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֹל הָיָה מִתְוַדֶּה עַל חֲטָאָיו וְעַל חֲטָאֵי הָעָם?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל אָדָם מִיִּשְׂרָאֵל יָכוֹל לְהִכָּנֵס לְקֹדֶשׁ הַקָּדָשִׁים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֲשַׁן הַקְּטֹרֶת כִּסָּה אֶת הַכַּפֹּרֶת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֹל הָיָה צָרִיךְ לִהְיוֹת טָהוֹר כְּדֵי לַעֲבֹד בְּיוֹם כִּפּוּר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קֹדֶשׁ הַקָּדָשִׁים&nbsp;הָיָה מָקוֹם פָּתוּחַ שֶׁכֻּלָּם יָכְלוּ לִרְאוֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֹל הָיָה טוֹבֵל בַּמִּקְוֶה לִפְנֵי הַחְלָפַת בְּגָדִים?</span></li></ol>"
}
